mp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-inset ring-gray-900/10 rounded-3xl\"></div></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-8 -right-8 w-48 h-48 bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 hidden md:block\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-red-50 text-red-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-1\">10+</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500\">Tahun Pengalaman</div></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px) translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 w-fit bg-red-50 text-red-600 mb-4\">Keunggulan Spesifik Kami</div><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-gray-900 leading-[1.1] mb-6\">Layanan, Jasa EO <!-- -->Gathering<!-- --> Terbaik di <span class=\"text-[#EF4444]\">Ngawi</span></h2><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8\">Sebagai provider B2B pilihan untuk layanan <!-- -->gathering<!-- --> di <!-- -->Ngawi<!-- -->, kami tidak sekadar menghadirkan &quot;fun games&quot;. Kami merancang program dengan pendekatan <em>experiential learning</em> yang 100% selaras dengan visi dan misi institusi serta budaya kerja Anda.</p><div class=\"bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-10 relative overflow-hidden group transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-red-500/5 hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin text-red-600 w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"font-display font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 text-2xl\">Layanan <!-- -->Gathering<!-- --> di <!-- -->Ngawi</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-800 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Program yang dirancang khusus untuk mendorong resiliensi dan inovasi tim dengan memanfaatkan lokasi historis.</p></div><div class=\"absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 opacity-[0.03] group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-64 h-64 text-red-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><h4 class=\"font-display font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 text-2xl mb-2\">Venue Favorit di <!-- -->Ngawi<!-- -->:</h4><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"group flex items-center gap-4 bg-white p-4 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-500\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center text-red-600 group-hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 text-base\">Benteng Pendem</span></div><div class=\"group flex items-center gap-4 bg-white p-4 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-500\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center text-red-600 group-hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 text-base\">Srambang Park</span></div><div class=\"group flex items-center gap-4 bg-white p-4 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-500\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center text-red-600 group-hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 text-base\">Watu Jonggol</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-12\"><div class=\"\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 md:p-10 mb-16 relative overflow-hidden shadow-sm\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-2 h-full bg-[#EF4444]\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-red-100 p-4 rounded-2xl shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-8 h-8 text-[#EF4444]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-2xl text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-tight\">Ringkasan Layanan</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed font-medium\">Growth Indonesia menyediakan layanan <strong>Gathering<!-- -->, Corporate Gathering, dan Team Building</strong> profesional di <!-- -->Ngawi<!-- -->. Kami merancang program berbasis <em>experiential learning</em> untuk meningkatkan kepemimpinan, kolaborasi, dan produktivitas tim Anda di lokasi-lokasi unggulan <!-- -->Ngawi<!-- -->.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-16\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-3xl text-gray-900 mb-8 tracking-tight\">Pilihan Program di <!-- -->Ngawi</h3><div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm\"><table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse min-w-[600px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-slate-50\"><th class=\"py-5 px-6 font-bold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100\">Kategori Program</th><th class=\"py-5 px-6 font-bold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100\">Fokus Utama</th><th class=\"py-5 px-6 font-bold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100\">Ideal Untuk</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors\"><td class=\"py-5 px-6 font-semibold text-gray-800\">Team Building</td><td class=\"py-5 px-6 text-slate-600\">Sinergi, Komunikasi &amp; Kepercayaan</td><td class=\"py-5 px-6 text-slate-600\">Karyawan Baru &amp; Tim Lintas Divisi</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors\"><td class=\"py-5 px-6 font-semibold text-gray-800\">Capacity Building</td><td class=\"py-5 px-6 text-slate-600\">Kepemimpinan &amp; Problem Solving</td><td class=\"py-5 px-6 text-slate-600\">Level Manajerial, Supervisor &amp; Eksekutif</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors\"><td class=\"py-5 px-6 font-semibold text-gray-800\">Fun Gathering</td><td class=\"py-5 px-6 text-slate-600\">Refreshment, Apresiasi &amp; Kebersamaan</td><td class=\"py-5 px-6 text-slate-600\">Seluruh Karyawan (Company Outing)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors\"><td class=\"py-5 px-6 font-semibold text-gray-800\">LDK OSIS &amp; Mahasiswa</td><td class=\"py-5 px-6 text-slate-600\">Karakter, Kedisiplinan &amp; Mentalitas</td><td class=\"py-5 px-6 text-slate-600\">Pelajar, Pengurus OSIS &amp; Organisasi Kampus</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-3xl text-gray-900 mb-8 tracking-tight\">FAQ Seputar <!-- -->Gathering<!-- --> di <!-- -->Ngawi</h3><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-100 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-[2rem] hover:border-red-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-300\"><h4 class=\"font-display font-bold text-xl text-gray-900 mb-3\">Mengapa Growth Indonesia menjadi EO Gathering pilihan di Ngawi?</h4><p class=\"text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Growth Indonesia adalah provider dan penyedia jasa gathering berlisensi yang berfokus pada experiential learning. Kami hadir sebagai EO Gathering pilihan di Ngawi untuk merancang paket team building yang diselaraskan secara spesifik dengan Core Values dan objektif instansi maupun perusahaan Anda.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-100 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-[2rem] hover:border-red-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-300\"><h4 class=\"font-display font-bold text-xl text-gray-900 mb-3\">Berapa harga paket jasa gathering di Ngawi?</h4><p class=\"text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Harga paket jasa gathering di Ngawi sangat bervariasi bergantung pada durasi, jumlah peserta, lokasi (venue), kapasitas, dan tingkat kustomisasi program. Kami menyediakan penawaran harga paket gathering yang sangat terjangkau dengan jaminan kualitas program dan impact bisnis yang nyata.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-100 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-[2rem] hover:border-red-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-300\"><h4 class=\"font-display font-bold text-xl text-gray-900 mb-3\">Berapa kisaran harga gathering di Ngawi dan LDK OSIS terbaru saat ini?</h4><p class=\"text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Untuk mendapatkan update harga gathering di Ngawi dan penawaran harga paket secara detail, silakan hubungi admin kami. Kami siap memberikan penawaran khusus dan RAB rinci, diampu langsung oleh fasilitator &amp; instruktur bersertifikat BNSP.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-gray-100 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-[2rem] hover:border-red-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-300\"><h4 class=\"font-display font-bold text-xl text-gray-900 mb-3\">Selain pelatihan SDM, apakah tersedia layanan jasa gathering di Ngawi untuk program fun games atau gathering?</h4><p class=\"text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Tentu saja. Sebagai penyedia layanan jasa profesional di Ngawi, kami juga ahli merancang acara company outing, capacity building, fun games seru, dan family gathering di berbagai destinasi favorit seperti Benteng Pendem, Srambang Park, Watu Jonggol hingga area bebas pilihan Anda.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 md:py-32 bg-white relative overflow-hidden\" id=\"trust-section\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-12\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16 md:mb-24\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 w-fit bg-red-50 text-red-600 mb-4\">E-E-A-T &amp; Proven Track Record</div><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#0A1628] leading-[1.15]\">Mengapa Perusahaan Mempercayakan Program Gathering di Ngawi pada <!-- --> <span class=\"text-[#EF4444]\">Growth Indonesia?</span></h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-lg text-slate-600 font-medium\">Kami bukan sekadar Event Organizer. Kami adalah mitra strategis untuk akselerasi budaya kerja, peningkatan kapasitas kolaborasi, dan regenerasi kepemimpinan.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-20 md:mb-32\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-red-50 text-[#EF4444] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award w-7 h-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black font-display text-[#0A1628] mb-4\">Standardisasi BNSP</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Seluruh fasilitator dan instruktur lapangan kami tersertifikasi resmi secara nasional oleh Badan Nasional Sertifikasi Profesi.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-red-50 text-[#EF4444] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-7 h-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black font-display text-[#0A1628] mb-4\">Zero Accident Policy</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Prioritas tertinggi kami adalah keselamatan. Setiap kegiatan dilengkapi Risk Management Plan dan Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) keamanan sekala industri.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-red-500/5 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-red-50 text-[#EF4444] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-video w-7 h-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 13 5.223 3.482a.5.5 0 0 0 .777-.416V7.87a.5.5 0 0 0-.752-.432L16 10.5\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-black font-display text-[#0A1628] mb-4\">Modern Documentation</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Paket yang ditawarkan mencakup tim media profesional dengan peralatan lengkap mulai dari Drone, Mirrorless, hingga produksi video cinematic.</p></div></div><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto relative\" style=\"width:auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl md:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#0A1628]\">Perbandingan Value &amp; Kualitas</h3></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/50 overflow-hidden relative z-10\"><div class=\"hidden md:block\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200 p-6\"><div class=\"col-span-4 font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider text-sm\">Aspek / Kriteria</div><div class=\"col-span-4 font-black text-[#0A1628] text-lg text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Growth Indonesia <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 text-[#EF4444]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"col-span-4 font-bold text-slate-500 text-lg text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Provider Lain <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-x w-5 h-5 text-slate-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"></path><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 p-6 items-center border-b border-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors\"><div class=\"col-span-4 font-bold text-[#0A1628]\">Metode Pembelajaran</div><div class=\"col-span-4 text-center font-semibold text-[#EF4444] bg-red-50/50 py-3 rounded-xl\">Experiential Learning Berbasis Objektif</div><div class=\"col-span-4 text-center text-slate-500 font-medium\">Sekadar Fun Games Konvensional</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 p-6 items-center border-b border-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors\"><div class=\"col-span-4 font-bold text-[#0A1628]\">Fasilitator &amp; Instruktur</div><div class=\"col-span-4 text-center font-semibold text-[#EF4444] bg-red-50/50 py-3 rounded-xl\">Tersertifikasi BNSP</div><div class=\"col-span-4 text-center text-slate-500 font-medium\">Seringkali Freelance / Belum Tersertifikasi</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 p-6 items-center border-b border-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors\"><div class=\"col-span-4 font-bold text-[#0A1628]\">Transparansi Harga</div><div class=\"col-span-4 text-center font-semibold text-[#EF4444] bg-red-50/50 py-3 rounded-xl\">Terdapat Kalkulator Budget &amp; RAB Detil</div><div class=\"col-span-4 text-center text-slate-500 font-medium\">Harga Sering Tertutup / Banyak Hidden Fee</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 p-6 items-center  hover:bg-slate-50/50 transition-colors\"><div class=\"col-span-4 font-bold text-[#0A1628]\">Kualitas Dokumentasi</div><div class=\"col-span-4 text-center font-semibold text-[#EF4444] bg-red-50/50 py-3 rounded-xl\">Premium (Drone, DSLR, Video Editing Cinematic)</div><div class=\"col-span-4 text-center text-slate-500 font-medium\">Standar HP / Dokumentasi Seadanya</div></div></div><div class=\"block md:hidden\"><div class=\"p-6 border-b border-slate-200\"><div class=\"font-black text-[#0A1628] text-lg mb-4 text-center border-b border-slate-100 pb-2\">Metode Pembelajaran</div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-2xl p-4 text-center border border-red-100 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"font-bold text-[#0A1628] text-xs mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide opacity-50\">Growth ID</div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-6 h-6 text-[#EF4444] mx-auto mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><div class=\"font-bold text-[#EF4444] text-sm leading-snug\">Experiential Learning Berbasis Objektif</div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-4 text-center border border-slate-100 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"font-bold text-slate-400 text-xs mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide\">Provider Lain</div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-x w-6 h-6 text-slate-300 mx-auto mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"></path><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"></path></svg><div class=\"font-medium text-slate-500 text-sm leading-snug\">Sekadar Fun Games Konvensional</div></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 border-b border-slate-200\"><div class=\"font-black text-[#0A1628] text-lg mb-4 text-center border-b border-slate-